# Native worktrees (claude --worktree / EnterWorktree) copy these ignored local files into new checkouts.
# Uses .gitignore syntax; copies only files both matched and ignored.
#
# Copy all projects/ so new worktrees include real project data and the configuration DB.
# Copies, not symlinks: independent per-worktree data prevents Alembic migrations from affecting others.
# Cost: approximately 1.6GB per worktree, mainly versions/ history and media.
# arcreel.db uses WAL; stop development servers before worktree creation to avoid inconsistent snapshots.
.env
.env.local
.vscode/
.claude/settings.local.json
projects/
